# Pseudo-random numbers. The clean uniform interface; the per-env native implementation is selected at build time and hidden. Random by nature, so this is an explicit escape hatch, never used in the deterministic language core (use vacuum or fillWillPattern there).

load @term/base/code/native/random
  find random-number
  find random-integer

task number
  like number
  send back
    call random-number

task integer
  take low, like number
  take high, like number
  like number
  send back
    call random-integer
      read low
      read high
